    "text.report.intro": "Three-class Vietnamese sentiment analysis on the VLSP dataset. Comprehensive benchmark of 6 architectures (TF-IDF + LinearSVC, TF-IDF + 1D-CNN, TextCNN, BiLSTM, CNN+BiLSTM, PhoBERT-base-v2) across Base and Augmented splits (12 runs total); detailed analysis of data augmentation impact and confusion matrices.",
