    "text.report.lexical": "EDA via lower().split() counts 149,705 tokens and 12,638 unique forms. 'không' appears 1,523 times, 'ko' 804 times, evidencing the need for spelling normalization while preserving negation. Frequent positive words include 'quá', 'rất', 'đẹp'; single-token frequency does not alone establish decision importance.",
